    "html": "<section class=\"lens-view lens-dispatch-view\"><h3>location-allocation-initialize · 1×1×1 workgroups × 256×1×1 lanes = 256 invocations</h3><svg class=\"lens-workgroups\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 24\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Workgroups\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-spatial-analysis-location-allocation-kernel-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#181818\" stroke-width=\"3\" data-state=\"selection\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"0\"></rect></svg><h4>Workgroup 0 (default)</h4><svg class=\"lens-lanes\" viewBox=\"0 0 1280 256\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Lanes in expanded workgroup\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-spatial-analysis-location-allocation-kernel-lanes-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><image width=\"1280\" height=\"256\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" image-rendering=\"pixelated\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" data-raster-width=\"32\" data-raster-height=\"8\" data-sampling=\"nearest\" href=\"data:image/png;base64,\"></image><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"0\"><text x=\"5\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">0</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"1\"><text x=\"45\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">1</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"2\"><text x=\"85\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">2</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"3\"><text x=\"125\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">3</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"4\"><text x=\"165\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">4</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"5\"><text x=\"205\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">5</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"6\"><text x=\"245\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">6</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"7\"><text x=\"285\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">7</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"8\"><text x=\"325\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">8</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"9\"><text x=\"365\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">9</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"10\"><text x=\"405\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">10</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"11\"><text x=\"445\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">11</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"12\"><text x=\"485\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">12</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"13\"><text x=\"525\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">13</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"14\"><text x=\"565\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">14</text></g></svg><p>256 lanes; first 15 and pinned lane labelled. Grey cells are idle or unavailable.</p><p>id probe not recorded; lane ids are computed from the dispatch shape · apple</p><figure class=\"lens-kernel-source\"><pre><code data-language=\"wgsl\"><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"1\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"2\">override INVOCATION_COUNT: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"3\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"4\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"5\">const selectedOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"6\">@group(0) @binding(0) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; selected: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"7\">const assignmentsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"8\">@group(0) @binding(1) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; assignments: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"9\">const bestCostsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"10\">@group(0) @binding(2) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; bestCosts: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"11\">const objectiveOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"12\">@group(0) @binding(3) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; objective: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"13\">const statusOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"14\">@group(0) @binding(4) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; status: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"15\">const chosenOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"16\">@group(0) @binding(5) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; chosen: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"17\">const DEMAND_COUNT: u32 = 136u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"18\">const FACILITY_COUNT: u32 = 136u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"19\">const MAXIMUM_FACILITIES: u32 = 5u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"20\">const MODE: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"21\">const NONE: u32 = 0xffffffffu;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"22\">const LARGE_COST: f32 = 1e30;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"23\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"24\">fn isNanBits(x: f32) -&gt; bool {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"25\">  return (bitcast&lt;u32&gt;(x) &amp; 0x7fffffffu) &gt; 0x7f800000u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"26\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"27\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"28\">fn isInvalid(value: f32) -&gt; bool { return isNanBits(value) || value &lt; 0.0; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"29\">// Unreachable costs (+Infinity, or the LARGE_COST sentinel of an unassigned row) are never summed.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"30\">fn isReachable(cost: f32) -&gt; bool { return cost &lt; LARGE_COST; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"31\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--workgroup-size\" data-line=\"32\">@compute @workgroup_size(256)\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--entry-point\" data-line=\"33\">fn main(\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"34\">  @builtin(local_invocation_index) localInvocationIndex: u32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"35\">  @builtin(workgroup_id) workgroupId: vec3&lt;u32&gt;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"36\">) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"37\">  _ = &amp;selected;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"38\">  _ = &amp;assignments;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"39\">  _ = &amp;bestCosts;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"40\">  _ = &amp;objective;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"41\">  _ = &amp;status;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"42\">  _ = &amp;chosen;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"43\">  _ = INVOCATION_COUNT;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"44\">  let workgroupIndex =\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"45\">    (workgroupId.z * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y + workgroupId.y) * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X +\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"46\">    workgroupId.x;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"47\">  if (workgroupIndex &gt;= 16777216u) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"48\">  let index = workgroupIndex * 256u + localInvocationIndex;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"49\">  if (index &gt;= INVOCATION_COUNT) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"50\">    return;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"51\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"52\">  if (index &lt; FACILITY_COUNT) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"53\">    selected[selectedOffset + index] = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"54\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"55\">  if (index &lt; DEMAND_COUNT) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"56\">    bestCosts[bestCostsOffset + index] = LARGE_COST;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"57\">    assignments[assignmentsOffset + index] = NONE;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"58\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"59\">  if (index &lt; 7u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"60\">    status[statusOffset + index] = select(0u, DEMAND_COUNT, index == 1u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"61\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"62\">  if (index == 0u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"63\">    objective[objectiveOffset] = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"64\">    // Any value but NONE: the first choose step is not stopped.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"65\">    chosen[chosenOffset] = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"66\">    \n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"67\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"68\">}\n</span></code></pre><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Resource</th><th>Access</th><th>Element type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>selected<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"selectedFacilities\">selectedFacilities</td><td>read_write</td><td>u32</td></tr><tr><td>assignments<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"assignments\">assignments</td><td>read_write</td><td>u32</td></tr><tr><td>bestCosts<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"location-allocation-best-costs\">location-allocation-best-costs</td><td>read_write</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>objective<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"objective\">objective</td><td>read_write</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>status<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"status\">status</td><td>read_write</td><td>u32</td></tr><tr><td>chosen<span class=\"lens-pr